model leg_on_row_twin
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.2 G1 S-6 (#211, plan §4): cut_leg_on_row's stated twin: the row's cash is on its own day, the row's on, with no on of the leg (4 900.00 PLN at the month's end, as the cut form gave on 2.1.8)."

source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

version stmt
  cite bank
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  opening[konto] = 5 000.00 PLN at 2026-02-01 start "wyciąg"
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-02-05, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to world amount 100.00 PLN) "line 1"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-02-28)
